					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-5763734#post-3854948</guid>
				<title>CHAMPIONS</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-5763734/doomsday-contest#post-3854948</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 29 Jun 2018 14:28:40 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Weryllium</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2727655</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Ohhhhh man, what a contest.</p> <p>First off, huge props to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=778357&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530478349" alt="ProcyonLotor" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=778357)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" >ProcyonLotor</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530478349" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" >A Random Day</a></span> for keeping this whole thing running smoothly and for rolling with the punches.</p> <p>A big hug and thanks to my awesome teammates <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cadavercommander" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3187823&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530478349" alt="CadaverCommander" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3187823)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cadavercommander" >CadaverCommander</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3129691&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530478349" alt="Modern_Erasmus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3129691)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus" >Modern_Erasmus</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fieldstone" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1436137&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530478349" alt="fieldstone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1436137)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fieldstone" >fieldstone</a></span>. Working with you all was a blast and I'd do it again in a heartbeat. I enjoyed building and destroying this world with you guys :D</p> <p>BIG Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2938475&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530478349" alt="Zhange" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2938475)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" >Zhange</a></span> for the absolutely <em>gorgeous</em> banner gracing our hub.</p> <p>Shout out to Team &quot;I Don't Want to Die&quot;, for giving us a run for our money and ultimately being worthy rivals.</p> <p>A big shoutout to every team who entered, especially the newer users. It takes a lot of guts to enter a contest like this, even more so if you've never written before. So props to y'all!</p> <p>And of course, thank you to the readers, the real winners who get to enjoy a buffet of great works. Do make some time to read <em>all</em> the teams :)</p> <p>See y'all in the next team contest!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-5763734#post-3854899</guid>
				<title>T E A M B I R D B E S T T E A M</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-5763734/doomsday-contest#post-3854899</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 29 Jun 2018 13:59:20 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>not_a_seagull</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3009022</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I’d like to congratulate a large group of people.</p> <p>First of all, congrats to Team Clever Gentlemen for winning this contest. Y’all had some great tales that were tons of fun to read.</p> <p>Next, I’d like to thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530280760" alt="FloppyPhoenix" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" >FloppyPhoenix</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aers" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1856789&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530280760" alt="Dr Aers" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1856789)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aers" >Dr Aers</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quantum-physician" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2033292&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530280760" alt="Quantum Physician" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2033292)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quantum-physician" >Quantum Physician</a></span> for competing in this contest with me. Y’all put out some great stuff, and I couldn’t have done it without you.</p> <p>I’d also like to shoutout <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mendelssohn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3110636&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530280760" alt="Mendelssohn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3110636)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mendelssohn" >Mendelssohn</a></span>, for making the art for the hub page. Massive kudos.</p> <p>Next, thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=778357&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530280760" alt="ProcyonLotor" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=778357)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" >ProcyonLotor</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530280760" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" >A Random Day</a></span> for running this contest. This is the first official contest I’ve participated in, and y’all made sure it was a blast.</p> <p>In addition, I’d like to thank all of the people who read and voted on our works. The reader is under appreciated in these equations, but they’re the ones who make it so all of our work isn’t in a vacuum.</p> <p>Finally, congrats to all the teams who put time and sweat into creating engaging works of doomsday and canon. I didn’t comment on everything, but I tried to read everything. Good job.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
